  5 REM PROTO-SPI SERIAL RECEIVER
  6 REM PORT 16384: DATA (8-BIT BYTE)
  7 REM PORT 16385: CONTROL (2-BIT HANDSHAKE)
  8 REM CONTROL VALUES:
  9 REM 0=IDLE, 1=READY, 2=ACK, 3=READY+ACK
 10 LET D=16384
 20 LET C=16385
 30 REM WAIT FOR SENDER TO ASSERT READY
 40 IF IN C<>1 THEN GO TO 40
 50 REM READ INCOMING BYTE
 60 LET B=IN D
 70 REM ASSERT ACKNOWLEDGEMENT (VALUE 3)
 80 OUT C,3
 90 PRINT CHR$ B;
100 REM WAIT FOR SENDER TO RELEASE READY (VALUE 2)
110 IF IN C<>2 THEN GO TO 110
120 REM CLEAR ACKNOWLEDGEMENT (RETURN TO IDLE)
130 OUT C,0
140 GO TO 40
